{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Esq.gif?t=1748641982\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/logo.png?t=1748641982\" /><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Dir.gif?t=1748641982\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You take control of a  cat lost in an unknown world. Armed only with your bow, you'll face precision-based challenges, solve environmental puzzles, and battle strange creatures that inhabit this mysterious place. Your journey will take you through neon-lit forests, energy-powered factories, forgotten cities, and other vibrant environments. All of this is accompanied by an immersive soundtrack with a distinct vibe that enhances the atmosphere and rhythm of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Stea1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748641982\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, shoot, and avoid deadly obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bow to fire arrows, calculating force and trajectory to solve puzzles and open new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies using your bow strategically, combining precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break false walls to discover collectibles and unlock new content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/TripleGif.gif?t=1748641982\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/gato_gif_2.gif?t=1748641982\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/gato_gif_2.gif?t=1748641982\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/gato_gif_2.gif?t=1748641982\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/gato_gif_2.gif?t=1748641982\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Port Hope Game Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an independent game studio founded by two friends, Zyel Nascimento and H\u00edcaro Lima. This is our first game as a studio, and we\u2019re very excited to present *Project Arrow* to you. We hope you enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Ilustracao_Sem_Titulo.gif?t=1748641982\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2408460?t=1748641982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748641982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c